speechtext:
1, 2 and 3. Mr. J. C. Dobbie of Port Arthur, Ontario, was appointed as a clerk, grade 3, economics and statistics branch, Department of Munitions and Supply on October 10, 1941. Salary $1,380 per annum.
4.	(a) Twenty-five years of age (medically unfit for military service);
(b) Graduate of Queen's university. Majored in economics.
